ing and transition expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/18/advanced-energy-industries-inc-aeis-q4-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"AEIS 2019 Q4","e":"aeis","d":"2020-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Oldham","x":"Those are coming from a number of actions we were able to take right off the bat around corporate costs, some initial structuring -- restructuring that we did, some actions that we took in the sales channel to get some efficiencies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/18/advanced-energy-industries-inc-aeis-q4-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"AEIS 2020 Q1","e":"aeis","d":"2020-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Oldham","x":"Expenses included $5 million of intangibles amortization, $2.8 million of acquisition-related charges, $2.8 million of stock compensation and $1 million of restructuring and transition expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/advanced-energy-industries-inc-aeis-q1-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"AEIS 2020 Q1","e":"aeis","d":"2020-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Oldham","x":"If you look at some of the things that have been passed in the U.S., which should be coming on stream now, they largely don't benefit either large companies or large companies that aren't having massive layoffs or furloughs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/advanced-energy-industries-inc-aeis-q1-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"AEIS 2020 Q2","e":"aeis","d":"2020-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Yuval Wasserman","x":"With growing demand for artificial intelligence applications, AI data center racks are projected to consume up to 7 times more power than traditional data center racks.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/advanced-energy-industries-inc-aeis-q2-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"AEIS 2020 Q2","e":"aeis","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Oldham","x":"Exclud