 non-GAAP results are stock compensation, amortization, acquisition-related costs, restructuring expenses and unrealized foreign exchange gains or losses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/05/advanced-energy-industries-aeis-q1-2022-earnings-c/"},{"c":"AEIS 2022 Q2","e":"aeis","d":"2022-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steve Kelley","x":"So we actually had a major price increase that happened last fall.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/04/advanced-energy-industries-aeis-q2-2022-earnings-c/"},{"c":"AEIS 2022 Q2","e":"aeis","d":"2022-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steve Kelley","x":"And if we need to raise prices again this year, we know how to do it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/04/advanced-energy-industries-aeis-q2-2022-earnings-c/"},{"c":"AEIS 2022 Q2","e":"aeis","d":"2022-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Edwin Mok","x":"Excluded from non-GAAP results are stock compensation, amortization, acquisition-related costs, restructuring expenses and unrealized foreign exchange gains or losses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/04/advanced-energy-industries-aeis-q2-2022-earnings-c/"},{"c":"AEIS 2022 Q2","e":"aeis","d":"2022-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Amanda Scarnati","x":"In terms of the impact of the new designs and sort of the restructuring of some of the components versus the sort of general supply easing, where did you see sort of the biggest benefit in the quarter in terms of outperformance?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/04/advanced-energy-industries-aeis-q2-2022-earnings-c/"},{"c":"AEIS 2024 Q3","e":"aeis","d":"2024-10-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Paul Oldham","x":"Data center computing grew again on strong AI-related demand while inventory destocking continued to limit industrial and medical revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/advanced-energy-aeis-q3-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2024 Q3","e":"aeis","d":"2024-10-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Paul Oldham","x":"Data center demand for our proprietary solutions remain strong on continued investments in AI infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/advanced-energy-aeis-q3-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2024 Q3","e":"aeis","d":"2024-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Oldham","x":"In addition, as we previously announced, we recorded a restructuring charge primarily related to the planned closure of our last production site in China by the middle of next year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/advanced-energy-aeis-q3-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2024 Q3","e":"aeis","d":"2024-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Oldham","x":"During Q3, we also recognized $28.5 million in restructuring expenses, primarily for employment-related charges tied to the closure of our last China production site.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/advanced-energy-aeis-q3-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2025 Q2","e":"aeis","d":"2025-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Stephen D. Kelley","x":"Yes, Steve, the content of an AI data center for us is much higher because the power consumption is much higher.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/advanced-energy-aeis-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2025 Q2","e":"aeis","d":"2025-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Stephen D. Kelley","x":"So typically, you're looking at 5 to 10x the power consumption of a non-AI data center.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/advanced-energy-aeis-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2025 Q2","e":"aeis","d":"2025-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Stephen D. Kelley","x":"Now let me provide some comments on tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/advanced-energy-aeis-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2025 Q2","e":"aeis","d":"2025-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Stephen D. Kelley","x":"The tariff environment continues to be very dynamic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/advanced-energy-aeis-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2025 Q4","e":"aeis","d":"2026-02-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Steve Kelley","x":"Working closely with key customers, we are developing new technologies and products for next-generation AI data centers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/advanced-energy-aeis-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2025 Q4","e":"aeis","d":"2026-02-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Steve Kelley","x":"In data center computing, fourth-quarter revenue increased sequentially to a new record driven by AI data center investment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/advanced-energy-aeis-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2025 Q4","e":"aeis","d":"2026-02-10","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steve Kelley","x":"Despite ongoing tariff headwinds, we are well-positioned to move gross margin above 40% in 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/advanced-energy-aeis-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2025 Q4","e":"aeis","d":"2026-02-10","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Oldham","x":"We executed on our gross margin improvement plan, exiting the year approaching our initial target of 40% despite the impact of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/advanced-energy-aeis-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2026 Q1","e":"aeis","d":"2026-05-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Stephen Kelley","x":"We are particularly well positioned to benefit from AI-related capacity investments in data centers and wafer fabs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/advanced-energy-aeis-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2026 Q1","e":"aeis","d":"2026-05-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Stephen Kelley","x":"In data center, based on strong customer adoption of our high-power AI solutions, we are raising our full year revenue growth expectation to the mid-30% range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/advanced-energy-aeis-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2026 Q1","e":"aeis","d":"2026-05-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Oldham","x":"Importantly, we achieved our initial milestone of gross margins of over 40% despite ongoing tariff expenses and less favorable market mix than we originally modeled.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/advanced-energy-aeis-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2026 Q1","e":"aeis","d":"2026-05-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Oldham","x":"And we had a very modest pickup from tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/advanced-energy-aeis-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2026 Q1","e":"aeis","d":"2026-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen Kelley","x":"I think we spent the last 3 years basically streamlining our manufacturing capacity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/advanced-energy-aeis-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2026 Q2","e":"aeis","d":"2026-08-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Stephen Kelley","x":"We are fortunate to be a leading player in 2 large and fast-growing markets, AI data center and semiconductor.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/10/advanced-energy-aeis-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2026 Q2","e":"aeis","d":"2026-08-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Stephen Kelley","x":"And I would say the defining feature of the AI data center is the very fast development cycle times.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/10/advanced-energy-aeis-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2026 Q2","e":"aeis","d":"2026-08-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Oldham","x":"During the quarter, we received the large majority of our expected IEEPA tariff refunds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/10/advanced-energy-aeis-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2026 Q2","e":"aeis","d":"2026-08-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Oldham","x":"We expect Q3 gross margin to be in the 41% to 41.5% range, up from Q2, excluding the onetime benefit of tariff refunds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/10/advanced-energy-aeis-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2026 Q2","e":"aeis","d":"2026-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stephen Kelley","x":"So we first try to mitigate the price increases from our suppliers through second sourcing and through negotiation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/10/advanced-energy-aeis-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2026 Q2","e":"aeis","d":"2026-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stephen Kelley","x":"But where we can't mitigate, we pass that through to the customer to preserve our own gross margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/10/advanced-energy-aeis-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2026 Q3","e":"aeis","d":"2026-11-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Stephen Kelley","x":"Looking ahead, based on customer forecasts and feedback, we believe that strong investments in AI data center and leading-edge wafer capacity will continue through 2027 into '28.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/02/advanced-energy-aeis-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2026 Q3","e":"aeis","d":"2026-11-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Shane Brett","x":"And could this sort of CPU or agentic AI opportunity become a meaningful tailwind for your data center business in 2027?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/02/advanced-energy-aeis-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AEIS 2026 Q3","e":"aeis","d":"2026-11-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Oldham","x":"Excluding the benefit of Q2 tariff refunds, gross margin expanded 140 basis points, driven by higher volume and manufacturing efficiency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/02/advanced-energy-aeis-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,7389,0,0,0,6212,776],[37,1,5601,0,0,0,4618,639],[38,1,6082,0,0,0,4903,796],[39,1,7170,0,0,0,5711,1063],[40,1,8580,0,0,0,6950,1218],[41,1,7941,0,0,0,6404,1168],[42,1,6781,0,0,0,5240,1124],[43,1,8949,0,0,0,7154,1437],[44,1,8719,0,0,0,6913,1403],[45,1,6059,0,0,0,4440,1249],[46,1,8013,0,0,0,6229,1395],[47,1,4988,0,0,0,3837,815],[48,1,7262,0,0,0,5660,1198],[49,1,6325,0,0,0,4735,1192],[50,1,7251,0,0,0,5366,1532],[59,1,7154,0,0,0,3119,2961],[62,1,5410,0,0,0,4364,780],[64,1,7602,0,0,0,5893,1399],[65,1,7355,0,0,0,5723,1348],[66,1,9043,0,0,0,6746,1938],[67,1,7194,0,0,0,5382,1501]],"cinema":[[36,1,7389,0,0,0,6212,776],[37,1,5601,0,0,0,4618,639],[38,1,6082,0,0,0,4903,796],[39,1,7170,0,0,0,5711,1063],[40,1,8580,0,0,0,6950,1218],[41,1,7941,0,0,0,6404,1168],[42,1,6781,0,0,0,5240,1124],[43,1,8949,0,0,0,7154,1437],[44,1,8719,0,0,0,6913,1403],[45,1,6059,0,0,0,4440,1249],[46,1,8013,0,0,0,6229,1395],[47,1,4988,0,0,0,3837,815],[48,1,7262,0,0,0,5660,1198],[49,1,6325,0,0,0,4735,1192],[50,1,7251,0,0,0,5366,1532],[59,1,7154,0,0,0,3119,2961],[62,1,5410,0,0,0,4364,780],[64,1,7602,0,0,0,5893,1399],[65,1,7355,0,0,0,5723,1348],[66,1,9043,0,0,0,6746,1938],[67,1,7194,0,0,0,5382,1501]],"imax":[[36,1,7389,0,0,0,6212,776],[37,1,5601,0,0,0,4618,639],[38,1,6082,0,0,0,4903,796],[39,1,7170,0,0,0,5711,1063],[40,1,8580,0,0,0,6950,1218],[41,1,7941,0,0,0,6404,1168],[42,1,6781,0,0,0,5240,1124],[43,1,8949,0,0,0,7